    "racesIntroduction": "2026年度Hackathon软件难题挑战赛",
    "title": "【2026Hackathon决赛】11：DevEco Code Agent上下文治理优化",
    "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">DevEco Code Agent<span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">上下文治理优化</span></span><span></span></h1>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">2<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">背景信息</span></span><span></span></h1>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">业界</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">OpenCode</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">等代码生成工具受限于大模型上下文窗口长度和推理成本，采用短上下文设计（通常仅支持</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">8K-32K Token</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）。在处理复杂代码任务时，由于历史记忆易缺失导致代码生成质量严重下降。具体表现为：代码补全不准确（准确率下降约</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">35%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、跨文件依赖理解不足（相关代码召回率仅约</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">45%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、长期任务规划能力弱（多步骤任务完成率低于</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">50%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">DevEco Code Agent</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">采用了长上下文（</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">128K+</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）的技术路线。但是长上下文场景下有效信息被淹没在大量冗余内容中，造成</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">KV Cache</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">利用率低下（当前约</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">35-40%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）、推理延迟增加（端到端延迟可达</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">2-3</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秒）、吞吐量下降（并发能力降低约</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">40%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">Agent</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上下文治理具有以下<b>难点</b>：</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">1. </span><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">多维度重要性评估难以精准</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：判断过往记忆对当前任务是否有价值贡献，避免误删关键上下文导致生成质量断崖式下降，同时精准过滤无价值冗余信息的评估体系设计困难。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">2. </span><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">知识检索难以平衡召回率与精确率</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：从海量知识库内容中精准筛选与任务相关的知识片段，召回率高但精确率低、信息密度稀疏导致有效上下文利用率不足。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">3. </span><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">工具输出压缩难以兼顾关键信息保留</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：对工具输出内容进行有效信息提取与压缩，在保留关键业务数据和执行结果的前提下剔除低价值内容，平衡难度大。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">3<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">问题描述</span></span><span></span></h1>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">本难题期望构建智能上下文治理系统，包含两个核心模块：</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">信息重要性分析（在压缩之前）：对输入的上下文信息进行多维度重要性评估。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">综合考虑与当前任务的语义匹配度、是否为新信息、历史效用等因素，识别出对当前任务最关键的记忆片段、知识库内容和工具使用记录。评估模型需在</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">100ms</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">内完成单次评估。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自适应压缩与治理（在评估之后）：根据可用上下文窗口大小和任务类型，动态选择最优压缩策略。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">压缩策略包括：选择性保留（保留高重要性条目，丢弃低重要性条目）、摘要压缩（对长文档进行关键信息提取，压缩比可达</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">3-5</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">倍）、去重合并（合并重复或相似的上下文内容）。在保留关键信息的同时去除冗余内容，确保语义完整性。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">4<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">期望达到的指标和效果</span></span><span></span></h1>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系统约束</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">代码生成效果指标不劣化</span><span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">系统目标</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">在满足<b>系统约束</b>的前提下。尽最大可能提升上下文压缩率、首</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">token</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时延</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">TTFT</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和一次处理复杂请求数量。</span><b><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">具体评分规则参考第七部分。</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">5<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">测试用例</span></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"tab-stops: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">当前提供测试用例的输入输出项做参考。</span></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm; tab-stops: 21.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">输入：</span><span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"data-preserve-origin-style\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background: white; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid transparent; width: 100%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 33.2096%;\"><col style=\"width: 66.7904%;\"></colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">位置</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-left: none; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">用途</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">spec/&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">题目</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">ID&gt;.md</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-right: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">赛题需求说明</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">metadata/&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">题目</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">ID&gt;.json</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-right: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">基线提交号</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">base_commit</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">和基线文件路径</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">baseline_bundle</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">repo_bundles/</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-right: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">固定工程快照，不含上游</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> Git </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">历史</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">templates/</span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; border-right: solid #E3E3EE 1.0pt; padding: 4.5pt 9.0pt 4.5pt 9.0pt;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\">成果提交、来源说明和过程记录模板</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #252b3a; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">输出：</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">独立、完整的工程，包含源码、资源、依赖配置和锁文件，不能只提交</span><span> HAP </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">或截图。</span><span></span></li>\n<li><span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">每次压缩的上下文压缩率、每个</span><span>session</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的首</span><span>Token</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时延</span><span>TTFT</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span><span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">6<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">评选标准</span></span><span></span></h1>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">不满足系统约束不得分</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">满足系统约束的前提下，按以下标准评分</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">：</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">上下文长度压缩（</span><span>60%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）：最大化上下文长度压缩。达成或由于理想压缩率（</span><span>25%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）的，按照排名得分在</span><span>30-60</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分布；劣于理想的，按照排名得分在</span><span>0-30</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分布。</span><span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">首</span><span>Token</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时延</span><span>TTFT</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（</span><span>40%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）：达成或由于理想时延降低（</span><span>25%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）的，按照排名得分在</span><span>20-40</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分布；劣于理想的，按照排名得分在</span><span>0-20</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">分布。</span><span></span></li>\n</ul>",
